# CLIo logo - Pixel
# Pixel letters in half blocks (two pixels per character cell, the
# same trick as CLIo sprites) with a cyan-to-blue gradient; the o is a
# gold coin with a glint. Stays solid without colour. 32x5.
@palette
a=#aff0ff
b=#c2f6ff
c=#78dcff
d=#89e6ff
e=#3cb2ff
f=#f8a21b
g=#ffb729 on_#ffffff
h=#fcac22
i=#2d80fd
j=#2c73fb
k=#e2800f
l=#ffffff on_#da760c
m=#335feb
n=#3655e3
o=#c1640b
p=#b45b0a
q=#5fd7ff
r=#b8f4ff
s=#8ce6ff
t=#ffd23f
u=#2fa8ff
v=#2f6bff
w=#2f8aff
x=#ffa51a
y=#d9700a
z=#ffb729
A=#ffffff
@effect shine
@art
 ▄██████ ██      ██████
██▀      ██        ██
██       ██        ██    ▄▀███▄
██▄      ██        ██   █▀    ██
 ▀██████ ██████  ██████  ▀████▀
@mask
 abbbbbb bb      bbbbbb
ccd      cc        cc
ee       ee        ee    fghhhf
iij      ii        ii   kl    kk
 mnnnnnn nnnnnn  nnnnnn  oppppo
@small
▄▀▀ █   ▀█▀  ▄▄
▀▄▄ █▄▄ ▄█▄ ▀▄▄▀
@mask
qrr s   rsr  tt
uvv wvv vwv xyyx
